Arising out of the ownership, maintenance, or use of the motorcycle. The limit of liability for this coverage is $500,000 per occurrence.

B. Comprehensive Coverage

The Insurer will pay for loss or damage to the motorcycle caused by:

1. Fire;
2. Theft or larceny;
3. Windstorm, hail, explosion, earthquake, flood, or other perils;
4. Riot or civil commotion;
5. Falling or flying objects;
6. The weight of ice, snow, or sleet;
7. Vandalism or malicious mischief;
8. Collision with a bird or animal;

Subject to a deductible of $500.

